<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine firms buy 65,000 tonnes U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Philippine firms buy 65,000 tonnes U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine firms bought 65,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat, Manila grains traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The negotiations were concluded on Wednesday night, according to three Manila grains traders.</p>
<p>Other details of the wheat sale were not immediately available.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
